      "content": "therapists cant fix this though. they don't get it. it wasn't just a bad day or a breakup. my entire existence was documented and shared and now it's just... void. it's like the version of me that mattered is dead and gone. i'm just a shell carrying around a body that doesn't have a purpose anymore. it feels so pointless to keep going when the \"me\" everyone knew is already erased.",
